{"seq":3,"slug":"vector-buffer-lifetime-cache","title":"向量缓冲区生命周期、缓存局部性与溢出处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/memory-pipeline-vector/vector-buffer-lifetime-cache","wordCount":2825,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"向量缓冲区生命周期-缓存局部性与溢出处理\">向量缓冲区生命周期、缓存局部性与溢出处理</h1><p>一条跨境广告归因查询在 128GB 机器上跑得好好的，加一个 <code>GROUP BY (buyer_id, sku_id, ad_id, day)</code> 就 OOM 崩掉；再开一个 <code>LIMIT 1000</code> 却又能跑完。这不是「内存不够」，而是<strong>向量缓冲区在算子间如何被拥有、何时被释放、内存装不下时谁被允许溢写到磁盘</strong>这三件事没设计清楚。列存把一列变成缓冲区数组（见 <a href=\"columnar-memory-layout-encoding\">./1_columnar-memory-layout-encoding.md</a>），向量化算子一次处理 2048 行，morsel 把它们切成数千行的调度单元（见 <a href=\"morsel-pipeline-parallelism\">./2_morsel-pipeline-parallelism.md</a>）——本文补上第三根支柱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-所有权-可见性与生命周期三态\">核心概念：所有权、可见性与生命周期三态</h2><p>向量缓冲区与普通堆内存的差别在于三个同时成立的约束。<strong>所有权</strong>：一块 data buffer 在同一时刻只能有一个明确的释放责任人，否则不是泄漏就是双重释放。<strong>可见性</strong>：一个向量在算子链上被引用时，其底层缓冲区可能已被上游复用——「谁还能读它」必须由生命周期状态而非约定保证。<strong>复用性</strong>：同一个向量对象在一次查询中被反复重置（<code>reset</code>/<code>clear</code>）承载不同批次，这是向量化消除每批分配开销的核心手段。三态模型如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>谁持有</th>\n<th>允许的操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>裸缓冲区（raw）</strong></td>\n<td>已从 arena/池分配、未绑定向量</td>\n<td>内存池</td>\n<td>绑定、释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>活跃（live）</strong></td>\n<td>绑定到某个 vector，正在承载一批数据</td>\n<td>向量对象</td>\n<td>读、写、切片、被引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>悬挂（floating）</strong></td>\n<td>向量对象被 reset，缓冲区已归还池但句柄仍存在</td>\n<td>池（可被复用）</td>\n<td>重新绑定（旧内容视为失效）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>绝大多数执行期崩溃都源自把 <strong>floating</strong> 当 <strong>live</strong>：上游算子处理完一批把向量 <code>reset</code> 归还给池，下游仍持有指向该向量的 <code>sel</code> 或裸指针，池立刻把同一块内存分给另一个算子——下游读到的是别人的数据。DuckDB 用 <code>Vector::Reset()</code> 显式把向量退回 <code>CONSTANT</code>/空态，Velox 用 <code>BaseVector::resize</code> 与 <code>VectorPool</code> 管理同类语义（Velox 文档 <em>Vectors</em>，<code>https://facebookincubator.github.io/velox/develop/vectors.html</code>）；两者都把「谁拥有、何时归还」写进类型契约而非注释。</p>\n<p>缓冲区生命周期与执行阶段的关系可以画成一条状态流转：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[内存池 / arena&lt;br/&gt;按大小类分桶] --&gt; B[裸缓冲区&lt;br/&gt;已分配 未绑定]&#10;  B --&gt; C[绑定到 Vector&lt;br/&gt;live 承载一批 2048 行]&#10;  C --&gt; D{下游是否持有?}&#10;  D --&gt;|引用计数 &gt; 0| E[共享给 SEL / 切片&lt;br/&gt;父子数组零拷贝]&#10;  D --&gt;|不再需要| F[Vector::Reset&lt;br/&gt;缓冲区归还池]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[floating 可复用&lt;br/&gt;旧指针视为失效]&#10;  G --&gt;|查询未结束| C&#10;  G --&gt;|查询结束| H[整池释放或溢写&lt;br/&gt;分区写盘 + 回读归并]\">flowchart TD\n  A[内存池 / arena&lt;br/&gt;按大小类分桶] --&gt; B[裸缓冲区&lt;br/&gt;已分配 未绑定]\n  B --&gt; C[绑定到 Vector&lt;br/&gt;live 承载一批 2048 行]\n  C --&gt; D{下游是否持有?}\n  D --&gt;|引用计数 &gt; 0| E[共享给 SEL / 切片&lt;br/&gt;父子数组零拷贝]\n  D --&gt;|不再需要| F[Vector::Reset&lt;br/&gt;缓冲区归还池]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[floating 可复用&lt;br/&gt;旧指针视为失效]\n  G --&gt;|查询未结束| C\n  G --&gt;|查询结束| H[整池释放或溢写&lt;br/&gt;分区写盘 + 回读归并]</pre><p>这个模型解释了一个反常现象：<strong>查询变慢并不总是因为内存不够，而是池的复用把热的缓冲区换成了冷的</strong>——下次取到另一块物理页时，TLB 与 cache 全部落空。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分配策略-从-malloc-到-arena-与大小类池\">分配策略：从 malloc 到 arena 与大小类池</h2><p>向量化执行对分配器的要求与通用程序相反：<strong>分配次数极高（每批每列一次）、单次小而固定、生存期极短</strong>。逐批调用 <code>malloc</code>/<code>free</code> 带来锁竞争、元数据开销（每 chunk 约 16–32 字节头部）与碎片化。收敛形态是<strong>按大小类分桶的 arena 池</strong>，量化依据是分配放大比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(H + P)/(n \\cdot b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 是分配头、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 是对齐填充、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是批内元素数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是元素字节数——对 <code>int32</code> 向量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2048</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 2048</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2048</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>，头部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H \\approx 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span> 字节贡献约 0.4%；池化把它摊销到几乎为零，代价是<strong>池需预分配并常驻</strong>，于是池必须可增长、可回收且受查询级配额管理。</p>\n<p>Velox 给出一个可对照的骨架：<code>MemoryPool</code> 树按算子/连接/聚合建立父子层级，子池内存计入父池，根池由查询持有（Velox 文档 <em>Memory Management</em>，<code>https://facebookincubator.github.io/velox/develop/memory.html</code>）。DuckDB 侧由 <code>SET memory_limit</code> 设定字节上限（DuckDB 配置文档，<code>https://duckdb.org/docs/stable/configuration/overview</code>）。共同点是把「配额」与「分配器」绑在一起：<strong>配额不是事后统计，而是分配路径上的把关点</strong>——池在每次增大前检查剩余额度，不足就触发溢写，而不是等 OS 的 OOM killer 出手。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>分配开销</th>\n<th>释放/复用</th>\n<th>适配场景</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逐次 <code>malloc</code>/<code>free</code></td>\n<td>高（锁 + 元数据）</td>\n<td>立即归还分配器</td>\n<td>一次性大块</td>\n<td>并发锁争用、碎片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大小类池（arena）</td>\n<td>极低（O(1) 取桶）</td>\n<td>归还池，不还 OS</td>\n<td>定长向量批处理</td>\n<td>池常驻内存，需配额约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单调 bump 分配</td>\n<td>最低（指针前推）</td>\n<td>整池一次性释放</td>\n<td>阶段内短命临时区</td>\n<td>无法单独释放，峰值即总和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用计数共享缓冲</td>\n<td>低（仅计数增减）</td>\n<td>计数归零释放</td>\n<td>零拷贝切片、父子数组</td>\n<td>循环引用、跨算子悬挂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>bump 分配在物化边界处特别合适：哈希连接的 build 侧在探测结束前无需单独释放任何一块，一次拿完、整块丢弃即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"引用计数与扁平向量下的所有权传递\">引用计数与扁平向量下的所有权传递</h2><p>零拷贝切片把「一块缓冲区」变成「被多个向量对象共享的资源」，所有权于是从「谁分配谁释放」退化为「引用计数归零才释放」——Arrow 的 <code>Array</code>/<code>RecordBatch</code> 允许父子数组共享底层 buffer，切片只改 offset 与 length（Arrow Columnar Format，<code>https://arrow.apache.org/docs/format/Columnar.html</code>），一个向量可能只覆盖共享 data buffer 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>o</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[o, o+l)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 区间。引用计数带来两个工程陷阱：<strong>计数与切片粒度不匹配</strong>（父数组计数归零释放了 data buffer，而某个切片向量仍逻辑上指向它——正确做法是让每个持有者都对底层 buffer 单独计数），以及<strong>跨批悬挂</strong>（上游「处理完一批就 reset 复用」，一旦下游持有切片或 <code>sel</code>，reset 必须被引用计数挡住，否则就是 floating-as-live 崩溃）。</p>\n<p>变长类型的缓冲区分裂成三段（validity、offsets、data），共享语义更复杂：DuckDB 为 <code>VARCHAR</code> 引入 <strong>字符串堆（StringHeap）</strong>，多个 vector 可共享同一个 heap、各自只持有偏移量集合，<code>Reset</code> 时按引用计数决定是否真正释放——同一批的字符串因此落在连续内存里，正好服务下一节的局部性目标。选择向量（<code>sel</code>）最容易悬挂：算子常把「输入向量 + 输入 sel」组合成「输出 sel」而不复制数据，输入 sel 的生存期必须覆盖下游使用它的整个窗口，把它显式建模为借用还是持有，比写一句「不要提前释放」可靠得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存局部性与内存带宽-为什么-2048-行不是任意选的\">缓存局部性与内存带宽：为什么 2048 行不是任意选的</h2><p>向量宽度取 2048 行（DuckDB 的 <code>STANDARD_VECTOR_SIZE</code>，文档定义见 <em>Parallelism</em>，<code>https://duckdb.org/docs/stable/guides/performance/parallelism</code>）落在两个约束的交叉点。</p>\n<p><strong>约束一是算子内部工作集要装得进 L1/L2。</strong> 一个二进制算子至少需要两个输入向量加一个输出掩码。对 <code>int32</code> 列，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2048</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 2048 \\times 4 = 24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2048</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> KB，加上 validity bitmap 仍在主流 L1（32–48 KB）到 L2 之间；放大到 8192 行会溢出 L1，缩小到 512 行则 SIMD 展开与函数调用的固定开销占比升高。工作集估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>64</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{batch}} = n \\cdot \\sum_i s_i + \\lceil n/64 \\rceil \\cdot 8 \\cdot m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/64</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>：第一项是各数据列之和，第二项是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个 validity 位图按 64 位字对齐的开销——位图必须按整字处理，因为 x86 的 <code>_tzcnt_u64</code> 与 ARM 的 <code>rbit</code>+<code>clz</code> 都按字工作。</p>\n<p><strong>约束二是内存带宽而非算力才是上限。</strong> CPU 单核的整型/浮点吞吐远高于单核可用带宽，多数向量化算子（<code>=</code>、<code>+</code>、<code>sum</code>）是内存受限而非计算受限。有效带宽由 cache line 利用率决定：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>link</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{eff}} = B_{\\text{link}} \\cdot u/L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">link</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 是 cache line 大小（通常 64 字节）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 是这次访问真正用到的字节数。顺序扫描定长紧排列时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u = L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，利用率 100%；一旦按 <code>sel</code> 随机回表抓 <code>shipping_address</code> 这类宽变长列，每次只取 8–16 字节而仍拉整条 cache line，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u/L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 掉到 12–25%，带宽被浪费 4–8 倍——这正是延迟物化要等选择向量变短才回表的原因（Abadi 等，ICDE 2007；见 <a href=\"columnar-memory-layout-encoding\">./1_columnar-memory-layout-encoding.md</a> 末节）。硬件预取器只在<strong>步长规则</strong>的访问上有效：顺序扫描、跨列固定步长取值能被预取，按 <code>sel</code> 的随机下标访问不能，只能靠软件预取（<code>_mm_prefetch</code>）提前喂地址；<code>sel</code> 熵很高时连它也救不回来，算法层面的解法是换成一次顺序的<strong>归位重排（row-id compaction）</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"溢出处理-内存上限-溢写与回读\">溢出处理：内存上限、溢写与回读</h2><p>内存装不下时的正确行为不是崩溃，而是<strong>把可溢写的中间结构写到临时存储再回读</strong>。可溢写的边界恰好是物化边界：哈希连接、排序、哈希聚合需要完整的中间态才能产出第一行（Graefe, <em>Query Evaluation Techniques for Large Databases</em>, ACM Computing Surveys 25(2), 1993），因此它们既是内存压力的来源，也是溢写的主体。主流实现的一致性做法是<strong>先按分区键把中间态切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 份，逐份在内存里处理，装不下的分区整体落盘</strong>：哈希连接把 build 侧按连接键哈希成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 个分区，内存里只保留能放下的部分分区，其余写临时文件；探测阶段对驻留分区做内存探测，对溢写分区做基于排序的归并连接。Postgres 的 <code>work_mem</code> 控制单个排序/哈希节点转成外部算法前的内存额度（Postgres 文档 <em>Resource Consumption</em>，<code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/runtime-config-resource.html</code>），DuckDB 则用查询级 <code>memory_limit</code> 按需溢写聚合与连接。</p>\n<p>分区数与溢写代价的关系决定了调参方向。设中间态大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>、可用内存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、分区数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，退化为溢写的条件是个别分区超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_j M_j &gt; S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_j M_j = M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 不能无脑放大：越大，落盘的就是越多的碎文件，回读的随机 I/O 与句柄开销上升，且哈希表的固定开销按分区重复。工程经验是让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 取到「每分区约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>」并留倾斜余量，同时对<strong>数据倾斜</strong>（跨境电商场景里 <code>buyer_id</code> 的长尾极重）做二次分区——某分区仍超限时对它单独再哈希一层。写到哪也影响阈值：本地 NVMe 上早溢写划算，走网络的 shuffle 上则宁可多占内存。</p>\n<p>最后一条容易漏：溢写与回读必须暴露成指标而非静默发生。<code>spill_bytes</code>、<code>spill_files</code>、<code>peak_memory</code> 直接决定「这条查询为什么慢」的归因——多数「并行度调满不提速」的案例，根因是阶段里混入了溢写 I/O（见 <a href=\"morsel-pipeline-parallelism\">./2_morsel-pipeline-parallelism.md</a> 的 Amdahl 分析）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>向量缓冲区生命周期有裸/活跃/悬挂三态；绝大多数执行期崩溃是把悬挂态当活跃态读，正确做法是把所有权写进类型契约而非注释。</li>\n<li>分配路径用大小类分桶的 arena 池把分配头开销摊销到近零，代价是池常驻，因此<strong>配额必须绑在分配路径上</strong>（Velox <code>MemoryPool</code> 树；DuckDB <code>memory_limit</code>），而不是事后统计。</li>\n<li>零拷贝切片使所有权退化为引用计数；变长列的 <code>StringHeap</code> 共享与 <code>sel</code> 的借用/持有区分是两个高频陷阱。</li>\n<li>向量宽度 2048 行由工作集落进 L2 决定，真正的上限是<strong>有效内存带宽</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>link</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{eff}} = B_{\\text{link}} \\cdot u/L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">link</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>——随机回表把 cache line 利用率打到 12–25%。</li>\n<li>内存不足时按分区溢写、对倾斜分区二次分区，并以 <code>spill_bytes</code> 等指标显式观测；溢写阈值应随临时存储延迟调整。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"向量缓冲区生命周期、缓存局部性与溢出处理","id":"向量缓冲区生命周期-缓存局部性与溢出处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：所有权、可见性与生命周期三态","id":"核心概念-所有权-可见性与生命周期三态"},{"level":2,"text":"分配策略：从 malloc 到 arena 与大小类池","id":"分配策略-从-malloc-到-arena-与大小类池"},{"level":2,"text":"引用计数与扁平向量下的所有权传递","id":"引用计数与扁平向量下的所有权传递"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存局部性与内存带宽：为什么 2048 行不是任意选的","id":"缓存局部性与内存带宽-为什么-2048-行不是任意选的"},{"level":2,"text":"溢出处理：内存上限、溢写与回读","id":"溢出处理-内存上限-溢写与回读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Morsel 驱动并行与物化边界（pipeline breaker）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/memory-pipeline-vector/morsel-pipeline-parallelism"},"next":{"title":"向量化引擎架构与实现选型（DuckDB/Velox/ClickHouse）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/vectorized-query-execution-engine-simd/engine-implementation-ops/vectorized-engine-architecture"}}